===Nyanko Great War Kids 1, 2, 3 & 4===
The soft vinyls were created to appeal to the younger players of [[The Battle Cats]] as many other toys contain sharp corners and can pose as a choking hazard to young children. There are four sets of soft vinyls, which included the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]], other [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] rarities and [[Enemy Units]].
